graph TD
    User([User / Cashier])
    MobileApp[Flutter POS Mobile App]
    Backend[Laravel Backend API]
    OfflineDB[(Local SQLite Queue)]
    MoR[Ministry of Revenues API]
    Database[(Backend MySQL Database)]

    User -->|Enters Invoice/Sales Data| MobileApp
    MobileApp -->|Validates Input| MobileApp
    MobileApp -->|If Offline: Queue Data| OfflineDB
    MobileApp -- "If Online: Submit Invoice (HTTPS/JWT)" --> Backend
    OfflineDB -- "Background Sync (When Online)" --> Backend
    Backend -->|Stores Pending Invoice| Database
    Backend -- "Requests Temp Fiscal Token" --> MoR
    MoR -- "Returns Temporary Token" --> Backend
    Backend -- "Submits Signed Invoice" --> MoR
    MoR -- "Returns Fiscal Receipt (RRN/MRN)" --> Backend
    Backend -->|Updates Invoice Status| Database
    Backend -->|Returns Success & PDF URL| MobileApp
    MobileApp -->|Displays / Prints PDF| User
